---
import { SITE, NAV, COURSE_LINKS, TOUR_LINKS } from '../lib/site';
import PayLogos from './PayLogos.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<PayLogos />
<footer class="footer bg-navy grain">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="col brand-col">
        <div class="brand-en display">DIVING SHOP<br />ABARO</div>
        <p class="brand-desc">静岡市清水区にあるスキューバダイビングショップ「アバロ」。伊豆ダイビングを毎日開催！沖縄ツアー＆海外ツアー＆ライセンス講習＆体験ダイビングを開催しています。</p>
        <p class="padi"><img src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/S__91283460-784x1024.jpg" alt="PADI DIVE CENTER" width="60" height="78" loading="lazy" /><span>静岡市清水区のダイビングショップアバロはPADI（パディー）から正式に認定されているダイビングショップです。</span></p>
        <ul class="social">
          <li><a href={SITE.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a></li>
          <li><a href={SITE.facebook} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a></li>
          <li><a href={SITE.x} target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a></li>
          <li><a href={SITE.line} target="_blank" rel="noopener">LINE</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3 class="eyebrow">LICENSE COURSE</h3>
        <ul class="links">{COURSE_LINKS.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></li>)}</ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3 class="eyebrow">TOUR &amp; INFO</h3>
        <ul class="links">
          {TOUR_LINKS.map((l) => <li><a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></li>)}
          {NAV.filter((n) => ['/blog/', '/store/', '/contact/'].includes(n.href)).map((n) => <li><a href={n.href}>{n.ja}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <h3 class="eyebrow">SHOP</h3>
        <address>
          {SITE.address}<br />
          TEL：<a href={SITE.telHref}>{SITE.tel}</a><br />
          営業時間：{SITE.hours}<br />
          定休日：{SITE.holiday}
        </address>
        <div class="line-box">
          <img src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/IMG_2592.jpg" alt="公式LINE QRコード" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
          <div><strong>Official LINE</strong><br /><span>友だち追加で予約・相談が一番早い</span><br /><a href={SITE.line} class="btn btn-line btn-sm no-arrow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">友だち追加</a></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="bottom">
      <span>© {year} {SITE.name}</span>
      <span class="ft-note">伊豆・静岡のダイビング / 体験ダイビング / PADIライセンス講習</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
<style>
  .footer { padding: 4.5rem 0 2rem; position: relative; }
  .top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.6fr 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 2.5rem; }
  .brand-en { font-size: 2.6rem; color: #fff; }
  .brand-desc { color: #b9cbe8; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .padi { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: center; font-size: 0.78rem; color: #93a8cb; }
  .padi img { border-radius: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .social { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; font-family: var(--font-display); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; }
  .links { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0.8rem 0 0; display: grid; gap: 0.45rem; font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .links a { color: #dbe6f8; }
  address { font-style: normal; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #dbe6f8; margin-top: 0.8rem; }
  .line-box { display: flex; gap: 0.8rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1.2rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); padding: 0.8rem; border-radius: 12px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #b9cbe8; }
  .line-box img { border-radius: 8px; background: #fff; }
  .line-box strong { color: #fff; }
  .line-box .btn { margin-top: 0.4rem; }
  .bottom { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1.2rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #93a8cb; }
  @media (max-width: 960px) { .top { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .top { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
